{"4824310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vermin Protocol", "steam_appid": 4824310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infestation has spread beyond control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Vermin Protocol</strong>, you take on dangerous pest control contracts in farms. Armed with specialized equipment and your trusted air rifle, your mission is simple: eliminate the infestation before it spreads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track movement in the dark and hunt down the rodents hiding in every environment. Complete contracts, improve your performance, and become the ultimate exterminator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot counts. Accuracy, awareness, and efficient resource management are the key to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt rats across multiple detailed environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete pest control contracts with performance ratings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision shooting with realistic projectile mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments with immersive ambient audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track hidden vermin through sound and movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statistics and score-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable graphics, audio, and control settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for solo play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you contain the infestation before it's too late?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infestation has spread beyond control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Vermin Protocol</strong>, you take on dangerous pest control contracts in farms. Armed with specialized equipment and your trusted air rifle, your mission is simpl